  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the Africa-led Movement to End Female Genital Mutilation (FGM): Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This second phase will continue to work with others to support a movement within countries and globally to raise awareness and understanding of Female Genital Mutilation (FGM) and build support for efforts to end the practice. 
Phase I of the programme was called &#x201c;Towards Ending Female Genital Mutilation/Cutting in Africa and Beyond&#x201d; and ran from 2013-2018.</narrative>
  </description>
